#. ~ Description of "M12 "Cochmamauhtia" Pistol"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
msgid ""
"The M12 was designed as a less-than-lethal alternative to more dangerous "
"forms of crowd pacification, able to disable a target for up to a minute with"
" a single shot and few to no permanent effects.  While it cannot be said to "
"be nonlethal because it is not safe to use on targets with heart conditions "
"or epilepsy, it is a great improvement over the previous X04 \"Tecuacuilli\" "
"which, on unfortunately not-rare-enough occasions, could cause permanent "
"paralysis.  On this world, though, you don't think the M12's lethality or "
"lack thereof is going to be much of a concern."
msgstr ""

