#. ~ Description of gun "LV429-P Pulse Rifle"
#. ~ Description of "LV429-P Pulse Rifle"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"The LV429 fires a series of extremely short high-energy laser pulses, more "
"like bullets than a traditional laser beam, greatly reducing dwell time and "
"increasing weapon effectiveness.  Matrix crystal technology has made the "
"weapon compact enough to be man-portable and provided it with enough power "
"for essentially unlimited operation.  This is a prototype, obvious from the "
"bright red coloration of the barrel and grip, as well as the word "
"\"prototype\" written in large letters on the stock and the flammable symbol "
"next to it."
msgstr ""

